<Slide style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, background: '#FFFFFF', flexDirection: 'column' }}>

    <Box style={{ width: 1280, height: 56, background: '#1E4FA8', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between', paddingLeft: 40, paddingRight: 40 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#BFD5EF', letterSpacing: 2 }}>02 服务谁</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#BFD5EF' }}>空间适宜性审计工具链</Text>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ paddingLeft: 40, paddingRight: 40, paddingTop: 20, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 4 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 32, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8' }}>四类目标对象，四类具体问题</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#4A5568' }}>每一类都不是"缺一个选址工具"，而是缺一个"能追问自己结论的人"</Text>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ paddingLeft: 40, paddingRight: 40, paddingTop: 16, height: 520, flexDirection: 'row', gap: 18 }}>

        <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 18 }}>

            <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#FFFFFF', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', borderTop: '4px solid #1E4FA8', padding: 16, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 8 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 24, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230' }}>做适宜性评估的研究者</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>
                    <span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8' }}>问题：</span>结论在什么尺度下还站得住，说不清
                </Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>
                    <span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8' }}>拿到：</span>适用范围边界（如"仅适用 ≤4 倍决策单元"）
                </Text>
            </Box>

            <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#FFFFFF', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', borderTop: '4px solid #1E4FA8', padding: 16, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 8 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 24, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230' }}>期刊审稿人与项目评审</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>
                    <span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8' }}>问题：</span>报告缺了什么，缺的后果有多大，无从判断
                </Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>
                    <span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8' }}>拿到：</span>三条缺失各自对应的可核对数字
                </Text>
            </Box>

        </Box>

        <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 18 }}>

            <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#FFFFFF', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', borderTop: '4px solid #1E4FA8', padding: 16, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 8 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 24, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230' }}>下游数据使用者</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>
                    <span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8' }}>问题：</span>这个网格我能用到多细，会不会已经粗过我要决策的对象
                </Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>
                    <span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8' }}>拿到：</span>纯几何换算（100 m 网格每格约 2.78 口池）
                </Text>
            </Box>

            <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#FFFFFF', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', borderTop: '4px solid #FFC107', padding: 16, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 8 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 24, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230' }}>后续接手这套方法的人</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>
                    <span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8' }}>问题：</span>判据怎么写才不自欺 —— 这条最难自学
                </Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>
                    <span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8' }}>拿到：</span>八项判据自检清单与 24 条错误实录
                </Text>
            </Box>

        </Box>

    </Box>

    <Box style={{ paddingLeft: 40, paddingRight: 40, height: 40, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8B97A8' }}>以上都是目标对象，不是客户名单；本项目未接受任何委托</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#1E4FA8' }}>07 / 14</Text>
    </Box>

</Slide>
